Description: G Unity⁷ desktop
 The Unity7 desktop with the changes of the gentoo-unity7 overlay: the Unity
 shell on cinnamon-session with Nemo, the indicators, lenses and scopes, Unity
 Control Center and Unity Greeter.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the components of the desktop and recommends the
 applications installed by the overlay by default.
 .
 g-unity7-cleanup lets apt autoremove the packages of Ubuntu Unity that
 G Unity⁷ does not use.
